  "result": "```json\n{\n    \"smpl.ordering.models.OrderEventInfo\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Represents information on order-related events (comments). This model class encapsulates two key fields: a date (stored as a String) and comments (also a String), used to track events or notes associated with an order.\\n\\nKey methods:\\n- `OrderEventInfo()`: Default no-arg constructor.\\n- `OrderEventInfo(String comments)`: Convenience constructor that automatically sets the date to the current date (formatted as a short date string using `DateFormat`) and assigns the provided comments.\\n- `OrderEventInfo(String date, String comments)`: Full constructor that sets both the date and comments explicitly.\\n- `getComments()` / `setComments(String comments)`: Getter and setter for the comments field.\\n- `getDate()` / `setDate(String date)`: Getter and setter for the date field.\\n\\nNote: The date is stored as a formatted String rather than a `Date` object. When using the single-argument constructor, the date is automatically derived from the current system time using `DateFormat.SHORT` format.\",\n        \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/models/OrderEventInfo.java\"\n    }\n}\n```",
